{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957040/extras/e53ad30843964c45f21845dcb2bcc019.avif?t=1757934942\" width=1560 height=572 /></span><strong><br><br>The Art of <i>Star Birds</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This digital artbook takes you on a journey behind the scenes of this unusual collaboration between <strong>Toukana Interactive</strong> and <strong>kurzgesagt \u2013 in a nutshell</strong>. From the very first scribbles to polished 3D models, you\u2019ll see how rough ideas slowly evolved into a vibrant universe\u00a0for players to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across 96 pages, you\u2019ll find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concept art, prototype insights and plenty of sketches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evolution of the game\u2019s art style and its many elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character profiles of the bird crew and their tireless minions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Insights into the design challenges of merging kurzgesagt\u2019s iconic style with Toukana\u2019s game vision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of playful details, easter eggs and nods to sci-fi classics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a rare glimpse into the creative process \u2014 not only the polished results, but also the iterations, experiments, and happy accidents that shaped our journey. <br><br><strong>Spoiler free!</strong><br>This book only covers elements included up to the end of the Early Access version, so you won't find any spoilers about the later course of the story.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957040?t=1757934942","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957040?t=1757934942","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co